    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n <title>SEO Optimized Blog Post</title>\n <style>\n body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px; }\n .blog-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n .blog-title { font-size: 2em; }\n .post-meta { color: #666; }\n .post-content { margin-top: 20px; }\n .comment-form { border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin-top: 30px; }\n .comment-form h2 { font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n .comment-form input, .comment-form textarea { width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n .comment-form button { padding: 10px 15px; }\n </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<article class=\"blog-post\">\n <header class=\"blog-header\">\n <h1 class=\"blog-title\">The Impact of Technology on Modern Education</h1>\n <div class=\"post-meta\">\n <span class=\"author\">By Alex Johnson</span> |\n <time datetime=\"2024-01-20\">January 20, 2024</time>\n </div>\n </header>\n <section class=\"post-content\">\n <p>Technology has revolutionized the way education is delivered and received. From online courses to interactive tools, the educational landscape has transformed to accommodate new learning methods...</p>\n <p>In this article, we will explore how technology impacts teaching and learning, and what the future holds for educational institutions...</p>\n </section>\n <section class=\"comment-form\">\n <h2>Leave a Comment</h2>\n <form>\n <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" required>\n <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" required>\n <textarea placeholder=\"Your Comment\" required></textarea>\n <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n </form>\n </section>\n</article>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
